<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62862" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήϊον</span></b>  (A), 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾷον</span></b>  (q.v.), τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>standing
			crop</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς δ᾽ ὅτε κινήσῃ Ζέφυρος βαθὺ λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.147
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				288
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				20
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ σίτου τὸ λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					612a32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. σίτου βαθύ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.4.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήϊά τε σταχύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1389i
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				i 10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in later
			Poets, also, <i>corn-field</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				10.42
			</span></i> (in 
				Dor.
			 form); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληΐου κόμῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					88.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεία</span>
			, <i>booty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				3g
			</span></i> (Susa, from Didyma, <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>).</div>
